<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate down, 3-mo, 6-mo up.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate down, 3-mo, 6-mo up.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) edged down on Thursday for the one-month maturity and advanced for three and six months, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 20.50 percent, down 0.01, the three-month rate at 20.09 percent, up 0.03 and the six-month rate at 19.70 percent, up 0.01.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
